    "# Phase 1 Dataset Analysis — Telco Customer Churn (`telco_churn`)\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook loads the saved Phase 1 pipeline outputs for **Telco Customer Churn (`telco_churn`)** and documents the analyst's manual insights."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
